                ],
                "steps": [
                    {
                        "step": "OTEB-medium is available from Anaerobe Systems (http://www.anaerobesystems.com)"
                    },
                    {
                        "step": "The following text was taken from the above page: \r\n\r\n- ORAL TREPONEME ENRICHMENT BROTH (OTEB)\r\n\r\n- Products: AS-603 Oral Treponeme Enrichment Broth (OTEB) 10 tubes / pkg"
                    },
                    {
                        "step": "Intended Use: OTEB is an enriched medium for the isolation, cultivation and maintenance of Treponemes found as part of the oral flora."
                    },
                    {
                        "step": "OTEB is a complex peptone-yeast extract medium containing volatile fatty acids and serum for a source of long chain fatty acids. Volatile fatty acids and serum are necessary nutrients for recovery of Treponemes from the oral flora. Inoculation of the medium can be done using a gassing cannula or inside an anaerobic chamber. This medium is prepared, stored and dispensed under oxygen-free conditions to prevent the formation of oxidized products prior to use."
                    },
                    {
                        "step": "Final pH 7.0 +/- 0.2 at 25 degrees C."
                    },
                    {
                        "step": "Final volume 7.0 ml +/- 0.7."
                    }
                ]
            },
